    "preheader": "NIFTY 50 rose 1.68% as Reliance led; foreign investors bought ₹3,115 crore (provisional); Brent fell 7.63% to $104.77.",
    "subject": "Kubeerra Market Brief · Tue 3 Nov: NIFTY 50 up 1.68% as Reliance leads; Brent down 7.6%"
  },
  "brief": [
    "The NIFTY 50 rose 1.68% to 23,440.80 and the Sensex 1.66% to 75,692.78 on Monday, a third straight gain, as Reliance Industries rose 11.6% after its quarterly results; energy (up 3.92%) and metals (up 3.21%) led, and advancers outnumbered decliners about two to one on NSE.",
    "Foreign institutions bought a net ₹3,115 crore and domestic institutions sold ₹392 crore (provisional). The 10-year government bond yield fell to about 7.32%, and the rupee closed at a provisional 94.86 per dollar.",
    "Brent crude settled 7.63% lower at $104.77 a barrel on hopes for US-Iran talks. On Wall Street the Nasdaq fell 1.07% while the Dow rose 0.41%. India's October manufacturing PMI was 54.7."
  ],
